  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#origin-2 talks about the initial about:blank, and urls with a server-based naming authority, but says nothing about non-initial about:blank.  It probably needs to, because the DOM standard's default behavior would be wrong here.\n",
